# 🌱 STEP OUT AI

### Less Screen. More World.

> **STEP OUT AI** is an AI-powered outdoor adventure companion designed to get people away from their screens and into the real world.

Instead of encouraging users to spend more time inside an app, STEP OUT AI uses AI to generate small, personalized outdoor missions — then encourages the user to **put their phone down and go outside.**

---

## 🚀 What is STEP OUT AI?

STEP OUT AI turns ordinary outdoor time into an interactive adventure.

Users choose what they want to explore:

* 🌿 **Nature** — discover plants, trees, textures and wildlife
* 🏃 **Movement** — walking, running and outdoor activities
* 📸 **Photography** — find interesting patterns, reflections and perspectives
* 🧭 **Explore** — discover places and things you've never noticed

STEP OUT AI then generates an outdoor mission.

### Example

> 🌳 **Your Mission**
>
> Find a tree you've never really noticed before.
>
> Spend a minute observing its shape, texture and surroundings.
>
> ⏱ 10 minutes
> ⭐ +50 XP

Once the mission starts:

### 📵 PHONE DOWN

The user goes outside and completes the mission.

The screen is only the beginning.

---

# 🎯 The Problem

Modern technology keeps us connected, but it can also keep us glued to our screens.

People often spend hours:

* Scrolling
* Watching short-form content
* Gaming
* Browsing social media
* Sitting indoors

The result is less time spent exploring the physical world.

The **Touch Grass** challenge asks:

> How can open-source AI help people spend more time in the real world?

STEP OUT AI approaches the problem differently.

Instead of using AI to create **more content to consume**, we use AI to create **reasons to stop consuming content.**

---

# 💡 Our Solution

STEP OUT AI creates short, personalized outdoor missions.

### The experience

```text
Choose an adventure
        ↓
AI generates a mission
        ↓
📵 Phone Down
        ↓
Go outside
        ↓
Complete the mission
        ↓
Return & verify
        ↓
⭐ Earn XP
        ↓
🏆 Unlock achievements
```

The goal is to make the **screen the shortest part of the experience.**

---

# 🤖 Open-Source AI

Open AI is at the heart of the project.

The project is designed to work with **open-weight/open-source AI models** rather than depending entirely on a closed AI API.

This allows STEP OUT AI to potentially:

* Run AI locally
* Work with limited or no internet connectivity
* Keep user data on their device
* Swap models
* Experiment with different models
* Customize the AI for outdoor activities
* Avoid per-request closed-API costs

### Planned AI architecture

```text
                    STEP OUT AI
                         │
                         ▼
                 Mission Generator
                         │
                         ▼
                 Open-Weight Model
                         │
             ┌───────────┼───────────┐
             ▼           ▼           ▼
          Nature      Fitness    Exploration
             │           │           │
             └───────────┼───────────┘
                         ▼
                   Outdoor Mission
                         │
                         ▼
                    📵 PHONE DOWN
```

---

# 🧠 Why Open Innovation Matters

A closed AI API could generate outdoor missions, but an open approach gives STEP OUT AI much more control.

### 🔐 Privacy

Outdoor photos and other user-generated information can potentially be processed locally instead of automatically being sent to a third-party server.

### 📡 Offline Possibilities

With an appropriate local model, the core experience can potentially work in places with poor connectivity — such as hiking trails, parks or rural areas.

### 🔧 Model Freedom

STEP OUT AI isn't permanently tied to one AI provider.

Different open models can be tested, replaced and improved.

### 💰 Lower Running Costs

Local inference can remove the need for paying for every individual AI request.

### 🧪 Experimentation

Open models make it possible to experiment with prompts, models, fine-tuning and specialized outdoor AI experiences.

---

# ✨ Features

## 🌿 AI Outdoor Missions

Generate personalized challenges designed to encourage real-world exploration.

## 📵 Phone Down Mode

Once a mission begins, users are encouraged to stop interacting with the app.

The objective isn't more screen time.

It's **less screen time.**

## 🏃 Multiple Adventure Categories

Choose between:

* 🌿 Nature
* 🏃 Movement
* 📸 Photography
* 🧭 Exploration

## ⭐ XP System

Complete missions and earn experience points.

Example:

```text
Mission completed
       ↓
     +50 XP
       ↓
    Level up
```

## 🔥 Streaks

Encourage consistent outdoor activity with daily exploration streaks.

## 🏆 Badges

Unlock achievements such as:

* 🌱 First Step
* 🌳 Nature Explorer
* 📵 Phone Down
* 🌎 World Explorer

## 🎨 Modern UI

STEP OUT AI uses a nature-inspired dark interface with:

* Glassmorphism
* Animated elements
* Responsive layouts
* Mobile-friendly design
* Interactive mission cards
* Progress dashboard

---

# 🛠️ Tech Stack

## Current Frontend

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript
* Google Fonts

## AI Layer

Designed to integrate with:

* Open-weight language models
* Open-source vision models
* Local inference frameworks

Potential local inference options include:

* Ollama
* Hugging Face Transformers
* Browser-based inference where practical

