# ▶️ Run Locally

No complicated setup is required for the current frontend prototype.

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/stepout-ai.git
```

### 2. Open the project

```bash
cd stepout-ai
```

### 3. Run the website

Open:

```text
index.html
```

in your browser.

For the best development experience, use **VS Code + Live Server**.

---

# 🖥️ How It Works

### Step 1 — Choose

The user selects an adventure type.

```text
🌿 Nature
🏃 Movement
📸 Photography
🧭 Explore
```

### Step 2 — Generate

STEP OUT AI generates an outdoor mission.

### Step 3 — Phone Down

The user starts the mission and leaves the screen.

### Step 4 — Explore

The user completes the real-world challenge.

### Step 5 — Complete

The user returns and records the result.

### Step 6 — Reward

The system awards XP and achievements.

---

# 🔮 Future Features

The current version is the foundation for a larger outdoor AI platform.

Planned features include:

### 📸 AI Vision Verification

Users could submit a photo of their mission result and an open vision model could verify it.

### 🎤 Bird & Nature Sound Recognition

Record outdoor sounds and use an open audio model to identify them.

### 🗺️ AI Route Generation

Generate outdoor exploration routes using OpenStreetMap data.

### 📍 Location-Aware Missions

Create missions based on the user's surroundings.

### 📶 Offline AI

Run the AI model directly on the user's device.

### 👥 Group Adventures

Friends can complete outdoor missions together.

### 🌦️ Context-Aware Missions

Future versions could consider:

* Weather
* Time of day
* Location
* Difficulty
* Previous missions

---

# 🏆 Hackathon Challenge

This project was built for:

**Hacktoberfest Open-Source AI Challenge — Week 1: Touch Grass**

### Theme

> Build something with open-weight models or open-source AI that gets people off the screen and into the world.

STEP OUT AI directly addresses this idea by using AI to create experiences that encourage users to **spend less time looking at their screen and more time experiencing the world around them.**

---

# 🌍 The Philosophy

Most apps compete for our attention.

STEP OUT AI does the opposite.

### We don't want users to spend hours inside STEP OUT AI.

We want them to:

```text
OPEN
  ↓
GET A MISSION
  ↓
PUT PHONE DOWN
  ↓
GO OUTSIDE
  ↓
LIVE
```

### 🌱 Less Screen. More World.

